    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Greg a fond\u00e9 une entreprise nomm\u00e9e Alibi.com qui cr\u00e9e tout type d'alibi. Avec Augustin son associ\u00e9, et Medhi son nouvel employ\u00e9, ils \u00e9laborent des stratag\u00e8mes et mises en sc\u00e8ne imparables pour couvrir leurs clients. Mais la rencontre de Flo, une jolie blonde qui d\u00e9teste les hommes qui mentent, va compliquer la vie de Greg, qui commence par lui cacher la vraie nature de son activit\u00e9. Lors de la pr\u00e9sentation aux parents, Greg comprend que G\u00e9rard, le p\u00e8re de Flo, est aussi un de leurs clients...",
        "english": "Greg\u2019s startup Alibi.com is a huge success. Who knew so many people would pay big bucks for an alibi to hide their secret lives? Helped by his devoted, nerdy business partner Augustin and eccentric new employee Medhi, Greg is on a lucky streak. He even meets Flo\u2014the girl of his dreams. But she hates liars, so he pretends to be an airline attendant, and things get tricky keeping up the charade. Especially when he meets his future father-in-law, who happens to be one of his clients! Can he save face in the eyes of his fianc\u00e9e\u2019s family, keep his company from fechnbeing exposed, and avoid scandal and total ruin?"
